 EutC and of EutE, targeting them to the interior of the BMC (By similarity)"}],"commentType":"SUBUNIT"},{"commentType":"INTERACTION","interactions":[{"interactantOne":{"uniProtKBAccession":"P63746","intActId":"EBI-1128985"},"interactantTwo":{"uniProtKBAccession":"P63746","geneName":"eutS","intActId":"EBI-1128985"},"numberOfExperiments":2,"organismDiffer":false}]},{"commentType":"SUBCELLULAR LOCATION","subcellularLocations":[{"location":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000305","source":"PubMed","id":"20044574"}],"value":"Bacterial microcompartment","id":"SL-0544"}}]},{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"20044574"}],"value":"One side of the hexamer is concave and lined by hydrophobic residues, the other side has a slightly protruding, 6-stranded beta-barrel"}],"commentType":"DOMAIN"},{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000255","source":"PROSITE-ProRule","id":"PRU01279"}],"value":"Belongs to the EutS/PduU family"}],"commentType":"SIMILARITY"},{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000305","source":"PubMed","id":"9278503"}],"value":"In strain MG1655 the eut operon is interrupted by the CPZ-55 prophage, encoding 9 genes situated between eutA and eutB, which are translated in the other direction. CPZ-55 may prevent expression of the eut operon in strain MG1655. Strain W3110 does not have this prophage element and should be able to express the operon"}],"commentType":"CAUTION"}],"features":[{"type":"Chain","location":{"start":{"value":1,"modifier":"EXACT"},"end":{"value":111,"modifier":"EXACT"}},"description":"Bacterial microcompartment shell protein EutS","featureId":"PRO_0000201520"},{"type":"Domain","location":{"start":{"value":5,"modifier":"EXACT"},"end":{"value":103,"modifier":"EXACT"}},"description":"BMC circularly permuted","evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000255","source":"PROSITE-ProRule","id":"PRU01279"}]},{"type":"Mutagenesis","location":{"start":{"value":39,"modifier":"EXACT"},"end":{"value":39,"mo